            <head>The Queen's Matrimonial Ladder / A National Toy, With Fourteen Step Scenes; and Illustrations in Verse, With Eighteen other Cuts</head>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>QUALIFICATION.</head>
               <lg>
                  <l/>
                  <l>     In love, and in drink, and o'ertoppled by debt;</l>
                  <l>     With women, with wine, and with duns on the fret.</l>
                  <l/>
               </lg>
               <lg>
                  <l/>
                  <l/>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify">004s <lb/>
               </p>
               <div type="div3">
                  <head>
                     <hi rend="italic">Original Size</hi> -- <hi rend="italic">Medium-Size</hi>
                  </head>
