            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>DEGRADATION.</head>
               <p rend="justify">     To this have they brought thee, at last!<lb/>
               </p>
               <lg>
                  <l>     Exposed thee, for all men to see!</l>
                  <l>     Ah, surely, their pandering</l>
                  <l>                  shall quickly be past:</l>
                  <l>     'How wretched their portion</l>
                  <l>     shall be!</l>
                  <l/>
                  <l>    Derision shall strike them</l>
                  <l>                 forlorn,</l>
                  <l/>
                  <l>     'A mockery that never shall die:</l>
                  <l/>
                  <l>     'The curses of hate and the hisses</l>
                  <l>                  of scorn,</l>
                  <l/>
                  <l>     'Shall follow wherever they fly;</l>
                  <l>     'And proud o'er their ruin</l>
                  <l>                  for ever be hurl'd,</l>
                  <l/>
                  <l>    'The laughter of triumph,</l>
                  <l>                   the jeers of the world!'</l>
               </lg>
